Developer Guide
===============

Eclipse
-------

Following the initial checkout, or after updating dependencies in the Build.scala file, run:

  play "eclipse with-source=true"


Assets
------

When updating the bootstrap-xyz.js file, concatenate the modal, tabs and 
typeahead components, and add the bootstrap-fileupload and bootstrap-datepicker plugins.


Tests
-----

To run a single test:
  
  play "test-only com.zenobase.testing.BrowserTest"

To run all tests except Selenium tests:

  play -Dwebdriver.enabled=false test


Release Procedure
-----------------

  1. Push the code to the build server. This should trigger a build.

  2. Obtain the build number [CloudBees].

  3. Edit the "Custom JSON" field for the "Production" cloud [Scalarium]:

     3.1. Set play.build to the new build number.

     3.2. (if migrating) Set elasticsearch.replay to the previous clusterName and increment clusterName.

  4. Set up two new instances [Scalarium]:

     4.1. Add two instances named "acai-{build number}" in us-east-1a and "coco-{build number}" in us-east-1c to the role "Elasticsearch".

     4.2. Add the two new instances to the role "Play".

  5. Before proceeding:
  
     5.1. The build must complete [CloudBees].

     5.2. There should be no traffic [Google Analytics].

     5.3. The status check must show 4 nodes and green health [/status].

  6. Start one (if migrating) or both (if not migrating) new instances [Scalarium].

  7. As soon as a new instances is listed as "in service", remove all old instances from the load balancer [AWS Console].

  8. (if migrating) Start the second instance [Scalarium].

  9. Wait for the status check to show 4 (if migrating) or 8 (if not migrating) nodes and green health [/status].

  10. Stop one or (if migrating) both old instances [Scalarium].

  11. (if not migrating) Wait for 6 nodes and green health [/status].

  12. (if not migrating) Stop the second old instance [Scalarium].

  13. Set the "keep this build forever" flag [CloudBees].

  14. Cleanup (optional):

      14.1. Remove stopped instances [Scalarium].

      14.2. Remove the "keep this build forever" flag from builds older than a month or so [CloudBees].

      14.3. Remove instances that are no longer reporting data [New Relic].
